1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,400
Your wound is not your fault,

2
00:00:01,900 --> 00:00:04,360
but your healing is your responsibility.

3
00:00:05,320 --> 00:00:07,260
No one can rewrite your past,

4
00:00:07,680 --> 00:00:10,680
but you can decide how your story continues.

5
00:00:11,780 --> 00:00:14,040
Heal, so the pain ends with you,

6
00:00:14,460 --> 00:00:15,840
not with the people you love.
